objective inka_ok {
  ```
  A team adopting inka can maintain meaningful approvals and auditable records over a frequently edited argument, at a cost proportional to the size of each edit
  ```
  children: edit_cost_proportional, approvals_meaningful, records_auditable, truth_validity_separated
}
